+/* The two CLOSING statuses of the 2026-10-03 plan review (SYNTHESIS §0).
+   Deliberately muted: a task closed by ruling must not compete for the eye
+   with live work.  Neither has a .bar segment — they are outside the
+   completion count, so they are outside the bar. */
+.chip.dropped              {background:var(--idle-bg);color:var(--ink-mute);border-color:var(--idle-line);text-decoration:line-through}
+.chip.deferred             {background:var(--gone-bg);color:var(--gone);border-color:var(--gone-line)}
+/* A computed gate (dependency, stage verdict, database probe) and the
